      <rules>
        <rule name="Powr of the WAAAGH!" id="2e1b-ac13-ab83-4b7e" hidden="false">
          <description>Once, during a battle, Ghazghkull can unleash the power of the waaagh!. This can be summoned at any time including during an opponent&apos;s turn. For the remainder of that player&apos;s turn and all of the following player&apos;s turn Ghazghkull gains a 2+ Invulnerable save. In addition, for the duration of the Waaagh! all Orks pass their Leadership tests and Morale checks automatically and recover from pinning immediately. Orks fighting in close combat double their Initiative just as if they had charged and passed a mob size check this turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Goff Army" id="7c63-ca59-8837-aae0" hidden="false">
          <description>Ghazghkull is a member of the Goff clan and his army is shaped by his prejudices. An army including Ghazghkull must have at least one mob of Skarboyz but may not include more than one unit of each of the following: Kommandos, Burna Boyz, Warbuggies, Warbikes, Big Gunz, Lootas and Looted Vehicles.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Iron Gob" id="8878-0609-fd65-00ff" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="ca40-75a1-e945-b145" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="3a0f-a374-0430-c885" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Iron Gob" id="237e-c8ff-7f0d-51b9" hidden="false">
              <description>A mob led by a Warboss or Nob with an Iron Gob add +1 to their Leadership value.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Bosspole" id="346f-4990-8613-690c" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="69ff-f2f9-4261-565d" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="3c6a-029e-f216-3efc" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Bosspole" id="9af3-4610-f2de-20f5" hidden="false">
              <description>An Ork mob trying to mob up with a mob carrying a bosspole may re-roll their Leadership test if they fail on the first try.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Mega Armor" id="7bdf-3ccd-6ee6-121d" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="717b-961a-e21a-ad3d" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="3d41-6451-1abf-fd42" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Mega Armor" id="e9bf-6edc-cd76-09f6" hidden="false">
              <description>An Ork in Mega Armor gains a 2+ armor save and is armed with a shoota and power claw for free. However, an Ork in mega armor always moves as if in difficult terrain.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Mega Boosta" id="dfdd-bfec-642c-4065" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="dc02-a691-7c4d-0481" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="7a36-b571-a83f-5cca" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Mega Boosta" id="db5f-f5f1-abf0-39a4" hidden="false">
              <description>An Ork with Mega Boostas rerolls the dice to determine the distance they move when they are wearing Mega Armor. If a unit of Orks in Mega Armor includes some with Mega Boosters and some without, only the ones with Mega Boosters will gain the benefit of the re-roll while the others move the original distance rolled.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Stickbomb Chucka" id="700f-04b9-5c4a-6809" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="7249-7776-a874-6146" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="e095-89c5-b9f5-8daa" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Stikkbomb Chucka" id="effb-fcc4-09e5-677d" hidden="false">
              <description>A stikkbomb chukka allows a Mega Armoured Ork use frag stikkbombz so they can benefit from the frag grenades rule, but in order to do so they must attack with their base strength instead of using the Power Claw.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Adamantium Skull" id="a956-f0a3-0b51-69ef" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="1c59-c7be-c2e5-3028" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="8809-bdd7-9be7-4f02" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Adamantium Skull" id="3942-d175-d6c5-13fb" hidden="false">
              <description>The adamantium skull plate adds +1 Toughness. When Ghazghkull charges into combat he gets an extra free head butt attack against one model in base-to-base contact with him. The head butt is resolved as an attack made with an Initiative of 4, roll to hit as normal for a close combat blow and if a hit is scored roll to wound with Ghazghkull&apos;s Strength of 5. A model that suffers a wound from the head butt is stunned for the rest of the turn and may not attack in close combat.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Kustom Shoota" id="2b95-aa9c-7805-ae44" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="de18-9a77-8445-6fe4" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="090f-b92e-ff54-d9b7" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <profiles>
