    <selectionEntry name="Mad Dok Grotsnik" id="66b8-0644-f61f-4b12" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="96"/>
      </costs>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Mad Dok Grotsnik" id="1842-1d7b-01ef-be83" hidden="false" targetId="c017-ef4b-d0bf-9f22" type="profile"/>
        <infoLink name="Power Claw" id="aef9-b72e-1120-cc82" hidden="false" targetId="ff9c-5b94-680f-36d5" type="profile"/>
        <infoLink name="Slugga" id="3aba-034c-6c29-049c" hidden="false" targetId="1aaa-4805-c346-107e" type="profile"/>
        <infoLink name="Independent Character" id="a65f-c6bb-8ed7-2b70" hidden="false" targetId="4a60-7f7e-c37f-a4d6" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink name="Ork Mob Rule!" id="5a47-2742-50a0-db1d" hidden="false" targetId="1586-dbe5-3b2e-7590" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink name="The Power of the WAAAGH!" id="6c83-973e-2582-8097" hidden="false" targetId="7bb4-34ca-51f3-bb8c" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Mad!" id="c792-e5b8-3503-cc66" hidden="false">
          <description>Nutso, two slices short of a loaf, not playing with a full deck of Grot teeth - you get the picture! Because of this Grotsnik is completely immune to the effects of moral and pinning. During the Ork turn Grotsnik will always move straight towards the nearest enemy and assault if he is within range.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Bad Influence" id="1ebd-21cf-43b9-9925" hidden="false">
          <description>If Grotsnik is part of a mob his crazed enthusiasm for mayhem infects the Boyz as well. Not only do they become immune to the effects of moral and pinning but they also move straight towards the nearest enemy unit and assault if it they can - they follow their Mad Dock in his headlong charge to glory!</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="More Machine than Ork" id="893a-b03c-6449-f0a1" hidden="false">
          <description>The extensive rebuilding Mad Dock Grotsnik has undertaken increases his Toughness characteristic by 1.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="&apos;eavy Armor" id="9340-ecde-23b6-485b" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="5" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="3169-6a05-0ed0-f7ef" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="1091-2004-ea45-e3d8" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
