          </modifiers>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Grabba Stik" id="eff2-bc82-64e1-f093" hidden="false">
              <description>In close combat a slaver armoed with a grabba stik can make its full number of attacks even if it is 2&quot; away from an enemy moodel. The stik&apos;s effects may not be combined with any other special close combat weapons or attacks.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
